A radius 3 pool of acid spawns at the target location, doing [35, 47, 56, 64, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100)] Acid damage each turn for [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] turns.

All creatures caught in the mire will also suffer a [16%, 26%, 34%, 39%, 44% (TL1-5)] slowness effect.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
